<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112541" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῠλᾰκ-ός</span></b> , ὁ (on the
		accent v. Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
			1.150
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			2.128
		</span></i>), 
			Ep.
		 and 
			Ion.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύλαξ,</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Il.
			24.566
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>IG</u>
			12(8).356
		</span></i> (Thasos, <span class="entity">vi B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			1.84
		</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
			89
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			2.113
		</span></i>, al.; dub. in <i><span class="en">
			<u>OGI</u>
			674.12
		</span></i> (Coptos, <span class="entity">i A. D.</span>); <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. νεκύων Κέρβερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					29.38
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.132
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἥρως πόλεως φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Inscr.Prien.</u>
					196
				</span></i>
			: as fem., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοῦραι αἱ φυλακοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					1.2.12
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Φύλακος, ὁ,</span> as pr. n., <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				6.35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				15.231
			</span></i>: so <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Φυλάκη</span> (<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.695
			</span></i>, etc.), as distd. from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυλακή.</span></div>
